{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月17日，《商業內幕》發文稱，薩姆·奧特曼(Sam Altman)在2023年被董事會罷免後上演了「閃電復職」，黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)也能嗎？就在三年前，作為頭部AI公司的掌門人，奧特曼曾被董事會趕下台，但在員工和矽谷重量級人物強烈反對後，幾天之內便重返公司擔任CEO。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586750.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.836846+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:24:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"1bdabd118e594119e04bc4aa0bb6ca791b309efd4fe6cf152c96eaa896bd2218","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}